.TH PAD_PRESSED 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
pad_pressed \- True only on the frame the gamepad button went down
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqinput.h\(dq
.BI "bool pad_pressed(const Input *in, PadButton b);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
True only on the frame the gamepad button went down.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true if button b is down now and was up last frame.
.SH MODULE
input (src/engine/input/input.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pad_down (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
